  "reason": "The assistant asserts a false universal claim that directly contradicts the reference, which specifies that only citizens of certain EU/EEA states (and EFTA states) are eligible under settlement treaties, while other EU states are not covered by such a treaty.",
  "evidence": "“Gia, suenter tschintg onns da dimora legala e ininterrotta en Svizra, burgais da l’Uniun europeica che han in dretg da dimora cun validitad duraira (permissiun C) survegnan automaticamain la permissiun da dimora senza restricziuns tenor art. 4 Anhang I ALCP. Questa regla vala automaticamain e independentamain dal pajais d’origin, sch’ils criteris da durada e legalitad da dimora èn ademplids.”"
